                             "in every mode (repeatable). Bare NAME forwards the "
                             "host value (recommended for secrets: keeps the value "
                             "off every command line); NAME=VALUE sets it directly "
                             "(visible in check_cep's own `ps` entry). Values are "
                             "masked as *** in the plugin output. Names check_cep "
                             "sets itself are rejected.")
